<!-- The search glyph at the size the floating search bar's field wants it.

     A size variant rather than a second icon: TextInputLayout measures its start icon at the
     drawable's intrinsic size (the button around it is wrap_content), so the only way to make that
     icon smaller is to hand it a smaller drawable. @drawable/ic_search stays 24dp for the home
     screen's button and the drawer, where it is the right size.

     Keep the pathData in step with ic_search.xml — it is the same glyph on the same 24-unit
     viewport, only the declared width and height differ. -->
